WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

2
00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.277
What is the meaning of this check?
Do you want me to cheat?

3
00:02:33.403 --> 00:02:35.404
No. I'm just the middleman.

4
00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:37.614
Are you playing a joke on me.
or trying to cause trouble?

5
00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:41.285
Do you think you can
replace me if I fail?

6
00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.620
Look at this!

7
00:02:43.746 --> 00:02:46.707
I'm the only Golden Leg!

8
00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:49.501
- Make sure you remember that.
- It's not that.

9
00:02:49.627 --> 00:02:53.005
I just want a kickback.
Please don't tell anybody.

10
00:02:53.131 --> 00:02:55.299
You're trash!

11
00:02:55.425 --> 00:02:57.759
I'm sorry. Catch you later.

12
00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:24.578
Golden Leg! Golden Leg!

13
00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:35.232
You've been number one ever since
Fung got his golden leg broken.

14
00:04:35.358 --> 00:04:38.235
First as a player. then as a coach.

15
00:04:38.361 --> 00:04:40.195
I'm better than Fung ever was.

16
00:04:40.321 --> 00:04:43.073
Team Evil has won the Supercup
the last five years.

17
00:04:43.199 --> 00:04:45.575
- What's your secret?
- Secret?

18
00:04:45.702 --> 00:04:47.411
They just have the best coach.

19
00:04:47.537 --> 00:04:49.371
So you're confident
that your team will win again?

20
00:04:49.497 --> 00:04:52.165
Are you new?
Don't ask stupid questions.

21
00:04:54.168 --> 00:04:58.547
Good morning.

22
00:05:00.883 --> 00:05:02.342
Golden Leg.

23
00:05:03.177 --> 00:05:05.637
Hung! Good morning.

24
00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:11.101
Hung. your shoe's dirty.
Let me clean it for you.

25
00:05:11.227 --> 00:05:13.395
It's okay. I'll do it.

26
00:05:20.695 --> 00:05:22.821
Hung. I'll get the car.

27
00:05:22.947 --> 00:05:25.907
Hung. you said if I worked hard
I could coach my own team.

28
00:05:26.034 --> 00:05:27.451
I'm ready!

29
00:05:27.577 --> 00:05:30.912
I think I can train a team
to be as good as Team Evil.

30
00:05:31.956 --> 00:05:34.791
Do you really think
I'd let you coach?

31
00:05:34.917 --> 00:05:36.335
But you said-

32
00:05:36.461 --> 00:05:38.086
Get real.

33
00:05:38.212 --> 00:05:40.464
You're a joke.

34
00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:43.216
Take a look at yourself.

35
00:05:44.344 --> 00:05:46.720
This tattoo is all that's left
of your fame.

36
00:05:47.305 --> 00:05:48.430
Hung...

37
00:05:48.556 --> 00:05:51.475
I've served you for 20 years.
How can you say that?

38
00:05:51.601 --> 00:05:54.978
Let's be honest.
Things have changed.

39
00:05:55.104 --> 00:06:00.108
You used to be a great player.
but now you're nothing.

40
00:06:00.234 --> 00:06:01.860
I've had enough.

41
00:06:01.986 --> 00:06:04.029
I've kept you around for 20 years...

42
00:06:04.155 --> 00:06:06.698
but it's time for you
to take care of yourself.

43
00:06:06.824 --> 00:06:08.408
Hung!

44
00:06:08.534 --> 00:06:10.410
You've got a lot of nerve.

45
00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:12.996
If you hadn't tricked me
with a bad check 20 years ago...

46
00:06:13.122 --> 00:06:15.165
you'd be working for me right now.

47
00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:17.376
It was your idea to throw the game.

48
00:06:17.502 --> 00:06:19.044
Are you throwing a tantrum?

49
00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:21.630
Say it a bit louder.
Did you guys hear that?

50
00:06:21.756 --> 00:06:24.758
Make sure the reporters can hear it.

51
00:06:26.094 --> 00:06:29.346
Say what you want.
Take a look at yourself.

52
00:06:29.472 --> 00:06:32.516
Do you think anyone would believe
a crippled has-been like you?

53
00:06:32.642 --> 00:06:34.559
- You-
- Don't be angry.

54
00:06:34.685 --> 00:06:37.479
If you want to blame anyone.
blame yourself.

55
00:06:37.605 --> 00:06:39.564
Blame your own greediness.

56
00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.358
Get lost.

57
00:06:44.028 --> 00:06:46.279
One more thing...

58
00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:49.574
I hired that mob to break your leg.

59
00:07:23.317 --> 00:07:24.651
Yuppies.

60
00:07:39.417 --> 00:07:41.751
They're not very skilled
at playing soccer.

61
00:07:56.642 --> 00:07:57.893
What was that?

62
00:08:01.397 --> 00:08:03.273
I said...

63
00:08:03.399 --> 00:08:05.400
they're not very skilled
at playing soccer.

64
00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:11.490
You think you can do better?

65
00:08:11.616 --> 00:08:15.744
There must be a fusion
of mind and foot.

66
00:08:17.538 --> 00:08:20.040
What kind of fusion?

67
00:08:34.931 --> 00:08:38.391
My late idol. Master Bruce Lee...

68
00:08:38.518 --> 00:08:42.437
invented the ultimate kick.

69
00:08:42.563 --> 00:08:46.483
If you want to learn about it.
I'll give you kung fu lessons.

70
00:08:46.609 --> 00:08:50.904
Kung fu lessons?
You look like a janitor.

71
00:08:52.365 --> 00:08:54.491
My job as janitor is only temporary.

72
00:08:54.617 --> 00:08:57.118
I'm a postgraduate student.

73
00:08:57.245 --> 00:08:59.120
Postgraduate student?

74
00:08:59.247 --> 00:09:02.332
I'm trying to develop
an effective method...

75
00:09:02.458 --> 00:09:04.918
of promoting Shaolin kung fu.

76
00:09:05.044 --> 00:09:07.045
Here's my card.

77
00:09:08.965 --> 00:09:13.385
Authentic Shaolin school.
Mighty Steel Leg.

78
00:09:13.511 --> 00:09:15.428
Look! I know what I'm talking about.

79
00:09:17.098 --> 00:09:19.015
I don't need kung fu.

80
00:09:19.141 --> 00:09:22.102
I'm more of an intellectual.

81
00:09:22.228 --> 00:09:23.812
It doesn't matter.

82
00:09:26.774 --> 00:09:28.692
Look at this woman.

83
00:09:30.653 --> 00:09:34.322
Yeah. she's sexy. So what?

84
00:09:34.448 --> 00:09:35.574
No.

85
00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.492
Watch this!

86
00:09:50.756 --> 00:09:53.675
If she knew Shaolin kung fu...

87
00:09:53.801 --> 00:09:56.803
she wouldn't have fallen.
Get me?

88
00:10:04.687 --> 00:10:07.188
Shaolin kung fu
can work for everyone!

89
00:10:08.608 --> 00:10:10.900
Excuse me!
Do you want to learn kung fu?

90
00:10:11.027 --> 00:10:12.861
Are you crazy?

91
00:10:14.614 --> 00:10:17.073
Look over there.

92
00:10:17.199 --> 00:10:21.202
If she had studied Shaolin Iron Hand
parking would be much easier.

93
00:10:25.833 --> 00:10:28.501
Kung fu is wonderful.

94
00:10:29.295 --> 00:10:32.505
- Excuse me. do you want to learn-
- Here. Get lost.

95
00:10:33.966 --> 00:10:36.092
Hey. you should share that with me.

96
00:10:36.218 --> 00:10:39.554
Let's not fight. See that guy?

97
00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:43.350
What are you doing?
You're way too slow.

98
00:10:43.476 --> 00:10:44.976
That's it! You're fired!

99
00:10:45.102 --> 00:10:47.103
- I'm sorry.
- Get lost!

100
00:10:47.229 --> 00:10:49.898
If he knew Shaolin Flying Sword...

101
00:10:50.024 --> 00:10:52.192
he'd still have a job!

102
00:10:53.861 --> 00:10:57.113
You think Shaolin
is the answer to everything.

103
00:10:57.239 --> 00:11:00.075
There is nothing more powerful.
All kung fu derives from it.

104
00:11:21.138 --> 00:11:23.431
People have the wrong idea
about kung fu.

105
00:11:23.557 --> 00:11:26.226
It isn't really about fighting.

106
00:11:26.352 --> 00:11:30.188
Kung fu is a complete way of life.

107
00:11:30.314 --> 00:11:34.067
I'm looking for a good way
to show people...

108
00:11:34.193 --> 00:11:38.363
how it can make their lives better.

109
00:11:38.489 --> 00:11:41.157
- Enough already!
- But-

110
00:11:41.283 --> 00:11:45.578
I have important things to do.
I've heard enough.

111
00:11:45.705 --> 00:11:49.374
Please seize this opportunity!
Cripples can still learn kung fu.

112
00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:51.626
Who are you calling a cripple!

113
00:11:52.962 --> 00:11:54.838
This leg has kicked hundreds of goals.

114
00:11:54.964 --> 00:11:55.922
I'm sorry!

115
00:11:56.048 --> 00:11:58.007
Do you know who you're talking to?

116
00:11:58.134 --> 00:12:00.093
I'm the famous Golden Leg.

117
00:12:00.219 --> 00:12:01.678
You're...

118
00:12:02.847 --> 00:12:04.472
just a bum!

119
00:12:15.818 --> 00:12:20.071
- You think I'm impressed?
- Get these cans out of here.

120
00:12:20.197 --> 00:12:22.323
- Okay.
- Right away.

121
00:12:22.992 --> 00:12:24.993
Cheap trick.

122
00:12:55.399 --> 00:12:57.400
Get lost.

123
00:13:20.549 --> 00:13:22.759
Excuse me!
Can you help me move this?

124
00:13:22.885 --> 00:13:24.219
No problem!

125
00:13:30.601 --> 00:13:32.393
Your leg's amazing!

126
00:13:36.607 --> 00:13:38.024
Twenty cents!

127
00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:40.944
Only twenty cents?
How about an advance?

128
00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:43.238
No way! Get lost.

129
00:13:44.073 --> 00:13:46.282
SWEET BUNS

130
00:15:08.115 --> 00:15:10.950
Mui. ten steamed buns please!

131
00:15:43.734 --> 00:15:48.988
Using Tai Chi kung fu to make
steamed buns is a brilliant idea

132
00:15:49.114 --> 00:15:54.452
They look so sweet and tasty

133
00:15:54.578 --> 00:15:58.039
Your mastery is astonishing

134
00:15:58.165 --> 00:16:02.961
It shows in your every movement

135
00:16:04.964 --> 00:16:08.132
What are you doing?

136
00:16:08.258 --> 00:16:13.846
Singing is the best way for me
to express my greatest esteem.

137
00:16:15.099 --> 00:16:17.558
Wow. what a beauty!

138
00:16:19.645 --> 00:16:22.355
I'm not beautiful.
Don't laugh at me!

139
00:16:22.481 --> 00:16:24.816
I bet the steamed buns are wonderful.

140
00:16:29.446 --> 00:16:30.822
Delicious!

141
00:16:30.948 --> 00:16:33.741
Was that Shifting Bodies
and Transposing Shadows?

142
00:16:33.867 --> 00:16:37.662
No. it's Shove A Thousand Cattle
with Four Tails.

143
00:16:37.788 --> 00:16:39.580
Right!

144
00:16:39.707 --> 00:16:42.875
That's why the buns
are so tender. yet firm.

145
00:16:43.669 --> 00:16:46.754
Sixty cents each.
Two for a dollar.

146
00:16:48.507 --> 00:16:50.216
That much?

147
00:16:50.342 --> 00:16:52.677
They're worth every penny.

148
00:16:52.803 --> 00:16:55.013
This is all I have.

149
00:16:55.139 --> 00:16:57.515
- Can I pay tomorrow?
- No!

150
00:16:57.641 --> 00:17:01.144
Spoken with the grace and economy
of a true kung fu master.

151
00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:02.854
I'm a Shaolin master too.

152
00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:05.148
- Can I pay tomorrow?
- No!

153
00:17:05.274 --> 00:17:06.524
Okay!

154
00:17:10.487 --> 00:17:12.321
Here are some fine sneakers.

155
00:17:12.448 --> 00:17:15.908
I'll give them to you.
if you let me have one more bun.

156
00:17:16.035 --> 00:17:18.036
- I'll call the cops.
- Fine.

157
00:17:19.121 --> 00:17:21.039
Come on. give me a break.

158
00:17:21.165 --> 00:17:23.791
You're so beautiful.

159
00:17:25.127 --> 00:17:27.086
Shut up!

160
00:17:27.212 --> 00:17:29.297
Please stop singing.

161
00:17:29.423 --> 00:17:31.340
Just pay and get out of here.

162
00:17:31.467 --> 00:17:33.551
If you want to sing.
do it on the mountain.

163
00:17:33.677 --> 00:17:35.678
Only crazy people sing here.

164
00:17:36.805 --> 00:17:38.806
I disagree with the young lady.

165
00:17:40.059 --> 00:17:44.562
Just because you sing out loud here
doesn't make you a lunatic.

166
00:17:44.688 --> 00:17:47.273
My name is Dynamite.

167
00:17:47.399 --> 00:17:51.778
My dream is to become
a great composer one day.

168
00:17:52.446 --> 00:17:58.117
This gentleman's song
is very creative and sincere.

169
00:17:58.243 --> 00:18:00.703
- Thank you!
- You're welcome!

170
00:18:00.829 --> 00:18:04.123
I also love to sing.

171
00:18:05.501 --> 00:18:08.419
When I'm inspired
I feel so passionate...

172
00:18:08.545 --> 00:18:10.546
I could explode.

173
00:18:27.314 --> 00:18:31.317
My dream is to become
a great choreographer.

174
00:18:53.173 --> 00:18:54.340
Let's go!

175
00:19:31.253 --> 00:19:32.962
Have you lost your mind?

176
00:19:34.756 --> 00:19:39.010
Stand straight! Put your hands down!
Get to work!

177
00:19:39.136 --> 00:19:40.469
Lunatics!

178
00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:43.431
What's going on here?

179
00:19:45.767 --> 00:19:48.728
I never should have gone
for a facial...

180
00:19:48.854 --> 00:19:51.856
and left the place in your hands!

181
00:19:52.649 --> 00:19:53.941
What do you want?

182
00:19:54.067 --> 00:19:56.444
Relax. We were just having fun.

183
00:19:57.112 --> 00:19:59.113
I'm here for the buns.

184
00:20:01.992 --> 00:20:03.618
What about my buns?

185
00:20:03.744 --> 00:20:07.121
Okay! Okay! Just a minute!
Did that bum pay?

186
00:20:11.168 --> 00:20:12.501
He did.

187
00:20:13.629 --> 00:20:16.297
These are disgusting.
Get rid of them!

188
00:20:28.852 --> 00:20:38.819
First Brother!

189
00:20:39.988 --> 00:20:44.075
Okay. okay. Keep working!
Clean everything!

190
00:20:46.578 --> 00:20:48.788
Are you sick. First Brother?

191
00:20:48.914 --> 00:20:52.708
I've got a bit of a hangover.
What do you want?

192
00:20:52.834 --> 00:20:56.545
- I've had a revelation.
- A revelation?

193
00:20:56.672 --> 00:21:02.343
How to promote kung fu
in a brand new way.

194
00:21:02.469 --> 00:21:03.469
Not again.

195
00:21:05.138 --> 00:21:07.014
Singing!

196
00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:11.352
You know we're great singers.
You can't deny it.

197
00:21:11.478 --> 00:21:16.357
- Leave me alone.
- We owe it to our teacher.

198
00:21:16.483 --> 00:21:17.275
He's dead.

199
00:21:17.401 --> 00:21:19.402
- It's worth a try.
- Forget it.

200
00:21:20.404 --> 00:21:22.154
I told you to be down-to-earth.

201
00:21:22.281 --> 00:21:25.074
There's an opening here.
You can clean toilets.

202
00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:27.118
Don't waste your life
chasing dreams.

203
00:21:27.244 --> 00:21:30.371
Without dreams.
we're no different than anchovies.

204
00:21:30.497 --> 00:21:33.499
You are an anchovy.
you shoeless small fry.

205
00:21:33.625 --> 00:21:36.627
- Why chase your dream?
- Why not.

206
00:21:36.753 --> 00:21:39.755
The fire in my heart
can't be easily extinguished.

207
00:21:40.882 --> 00:21:42.800
Why not? Just blow it out.

208
00:21:42.926 --> 00:21:45.928
- But I can light it up again.
- Enough already!

209
00:21:46.054 --> 00:21:48.264
We both have our own lives.

210
00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:52.018
Please don't bother me.
I have to work to support my family.

211
00:21:53.437 --> 00:21:57.648
You're just going to forget about
your Iron Head after all that work?

212
00:21:57.774 --> 00:21:59.358
Never!

213
00:22:00.235 --> 00:22:02.611
I still practice my Iron Head...

214
00:22:02.738 --> 00:22:05.031
every single day!

215
00:22:05.157 --> 00:22:06.490
Fei!

216
00:22:06.616 --> 00:22:07.908
Boss.

217
00:22:08.035 --> 00:22:09.452
You idiot!

218
00:22:09.578 --> 00:22:12.955
You forgot to book
a band for tonight.

219
00:22:13.081 --> 00:22:16.500
- Don't worry. I have an idea.
- Tell me.

220
00:22:16.626 --> 00:22:19.962
Let's combine Shaolin kung fu
with singing and dancing.

221
00:22:20.088 --> 00:22:22.548
- What kind of Shaolin kung fu?
- Observe.

222
00:22:25.552 --> 00:22:28.471
Is he good enough
to perform on stage?

223
00:22:28.597 --> 00:22:31.682
- He's good enough.
- How about you?

224
00:22:31.808 --> 00:22:33.309
Me?

225
00:22:33.977 --> 00:22:35.811
Shit.

226
00:22:35.937 --> 00:22:37.813
How about your Iron Head?

227
00:22:38.815 --> 00:22:41.650
If you don't perform well.
I'll kill you tomorrow.

228
00:22:41.777 --> 00:22:44.570
- Sure.
- First Big Brother. thank you.

229
00:22:57.167 --> 00:23:01.545
- Shaolin kung fu is great
- Really great

230
00:23:01.671 --> 00:23:06.133
- Shaolin kung fu is wonderful
- Wonderful

231
00:23:06.259 --> 00:23:10.513
- I'm Iron Head
- Iron Head

232
00:23:10.639 --> 00:23:15.434
- He's Mighty Steel Leg
- Mighty Steel Leg

233
00:23:20.148 --> 00:23:21.524
Be serious!

234
00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:35.746
- Shaolin kung fu is great
- Really great

235
00:23:35.872 --> 00:23:40.418
- Shaolin kung fu is wonderful
- Wonderful

236
00:23:40.544 --> 00:23:44.380
- I'm Mighty Steel Leg
- Mighty Steel Leg

237
00:23:44.506 --> 00:23:46.924
He's Iron Head

238
00:23:50.387 --> 00:23:51.846
I'm choking.

239
00:24:24.629 --> 00:24:27.047
It sounds like you're
strangling a cat.

240
00:24:27.174 --> 00:24:28.549
This song sucks.

241
00:24:28.675 --> 00:24:30.217
You sounded like a dying animal.

242
00:24:30.343 --> 00:24:31.886
Who wrote that garbage?

243
00:24:32.012 --> 00:24:34.013
- Yeah. who?
- Who?

244
00:24:37.976 --> 00:24:43.314
Creative work is highly subjective.
so I'll accept your criticism.

245
00:24:43.440 --> 00:24:46.025
But it's only
the beginning of the show.

246
00:24:46.151 --> 00:24:49.778
Wait until we show you why we're called
Mighty Steel Leg and Iron Head.

247
00:24:49.905 --> 00:24:50.696
Iron Head?

248
00:24:50.822 --> 00:24:52.948
I told you the lyrics
were too intellectual.

249
00:24:53.074 --> 00:24:56.535
- I'm not Iron Head. He's-
- Iron Head?

250
00:24:58.288 --> 00:25:01.749
- Mighty Steel Leg!
- He's Mighty Steel Leg!

251
00:25:01.875 --> 00:25:03.709
That's your Mighty Steel Leg?

252
00:25:04.920 --> 00:25:07.213
- I'll kill you.
- Mighty Steel Leg.

253
00:25:08.715 --> 00:25:10.716
I'm the real Mighty Steel Leg.

254
00:25:11.384 --> 00:25:14.136
- Iron Head.
- Don't you understand?

255
00:25:14.262 --> 00:25:16.055
- He's the real-
- Iron Head.

256
00:25:16.181 --> 00:25:17.723
You're so stubborn.

257
00:25:19.434 --> 00:25:21.602
Do you want to fight
with a customer?

258
00:25:24.272 --> 00:25:28.400
Thank you so much.
Happy hour went by fast.

259
00:25:28.527 --> 00:25:31.237
It's time for us to say
good night right now.

260
00:25:31.363 --> 00:25:34.156
Let's listen to some music.

261
00:25:34.282 --> 00:25:36.534
You crazy guy.

262
00:25:39.412 --> 00:25:43.415
- Let's see how much you can take.
- Thank you.

263
00:26:44.311 --> 00:26:45.853
You're a bum.

264
00:27:49.751 --> 00:27:51.418
Come on. Nothing to see.

265
00:27:53.296 --> 00:27:56.090
You want some more?
Sure you want to fight us all?

266
00:27:58.593 --> 00:28:01.470
I promised my master
I'd never fight.

267
00:28:02.138 --> 00:28:04.765
I told you he'd wimp out!

268
00:28:04.891 --> 00:28:07.393
But I expect an apology!

269
00:28:08.269 --> 00:28:11.397
An apology?
You should apologize to us!

270
00:28:30.083 --> 00:28:33.168
You said you wouldn't use
kung fu to fight.

271
00:28:43.179 --> 00:28:46.014
I'm not here to fight.
I'm here to play soccer.

272
00:28:53.565 --> 00:28:55.607
So much for your kung fu-

273
00:29:00.655 --> 00:29:03.615
Don't be such a baby. What?

274
00:29:39.861 --> 00:29:41.737
I give up. I apologize!

275
00:29:58.963 --> 00:30:01.048
Do you have any change?

276
00:30:02.175 --> 00:30:03.509
Yes.

277
00:30:06.387 --> 00:30:07.721
Thirty cents.

278
00:30:08.389 --> 00:30:10.557
- Are you stealing my money?
- Yes.

279
00:30:10.683 --> 00:30:12.851
- Was that Praying Mantis Style?
- Yes.

280
00:30:12.977 --> 00:30:15.187
You should learn Shaolin instead.

281
00:30:43.758 --> 00:30:47.678
Can I see your leg?

282
00:30:47.804 --> 00:30:51.181
I don't care.
Do what you want.

283
00:31:02.193 --> 00:31:04.695
It's the real deal.

284
00:31:11.286 --> 00:31:13.954
It looks like an ordinary leg.

285
00:31:14.664 --> 00:31:17.249
It's Shaolin Mighty Steel Leg.
It's patented.

286
00:31:19.794 --> 00:31:21.962
You could use your kung fu
to play soccer.

287
00:31:24.299 --> 00:31:25.757
You think so?

288
00:31:25.884 --> 00:31:27.259
Yes. why not.

289
00:31:28.595 --> 00:31:29.678
Of course.

290
00:31:30.555 --> 00:31:33.140
That's a great idea. Kung fu soccer.

291
00:31:33.266 --> 00:31:36.935
Why didn't I think of that?
How do I go about it?

292
00:31:37.812 --> 00:31:39.688
You'll need my help.

293
00:31:39.814 --> 00:31:42.107
I'm Golden Leg. the soccer star.

294
00:31:42.233 --> 00:31:44.276
Now I'm a coach.

295
00:31:44.402 --> 00:31:47.029
- Great! You can teach me soccer.
- I don't know.

296
00:31:47.155 --> 00:31:49.072
It's a great idea.

297
00:31:49.198 --> 00:31:52.534
I'll think about it!

298
00:31:52.660 --> 00:31:56.872
There's nothing to think about.
We should start right now!

299
00:31:57.540 --> 00:32:00.334
We've got nothing to lose.

300
00:32:04.422 --> 00:32:06.924
It takes a lot of training.

301
00:32:07.050 --> 00:32:09.509
Let's do it! What do I need?

302
00:32:10.595 --> 00:32:12.471
A pair of shoes.

303
00:32:18.019 --> 00:32:20.520
Do you have the money for the buns?

304
00:32:20.647 --> 00:32:23.148
- No. but-
- I threw them out.

305
00:32:23.274 --> 00:32:24.566
Oh. my God!

306
00:32:24.692 --> 00:32:28.195
Those sneakers were a mess.
They were all worn out.

307
00:32:28.321 --> 00:32:29.738
I know. I know.

308
00:32:29.864 --> 00:32:34.409
If my boss sees you.
she'll start yelling.

309
00:32:43.169 --> 00:32:46.546
I couldn't bring myself to toss them.
I fixed them instead.

310
00:33:11.489 --> 00:33:15.242
First Brother. what's wrong?
Are you okay?

311
00:33:17.328 --> 00:33:19.079
I'm fine.

312
00:33:20.873 --> 00:33:22.290
What do you want?

313
00:33:22.417 --> 00:33:25.752
I finally found a great way
to promote Shaolin kung fu.

314
00:33:26.838 --> 00:33:29.256
Soccer!

315
00:33:31.676 --> 00:33:33.135
Please leave me alone!

316
00:33:33.261 --> 00:33:36.096
You got me into a lot of trouble.
They demoted me.

317
00:33:36.222 --> 00:33:38.682
Now I have to clean the toilets.

318
00:33:38.808 --> 00:33:42.894
- But we'd be great.
- No! Absolutely not!

319
00:33:43.021 --> 00:33:46.690
If you humiliate me again. my family
will commit suicide in front of you.

320
00:33:46.816 --> 00:33:49.359
Committing suicide
is not the answer.

321
00:33:49.485 --> 00:33:51.820
Be brave.
Believe in yourself.

322
00:33:51.946 --> 00:33:55.282
I'm a complete loser. Please!
Please don't ever come here again.

323
00:33:55.408 --> 00:33:58.910
If you want to form a soccer team.
just ask the other brothers.

324
00:34:00.121 --> 00:34:02.831
Please. no more!

325
00:34:02.957 --> 00:34:04.791
Hopeless.

326
00:34:10.882 --> 00:34:12.340
Good morning. Fourth Brother.

327
00:34:12.467 --> 00:34:15.010
Good morning. Sing.
How are you?

328
00:34:15.136 --> 00:34:17.471
Let me introduce you
to a great guy. He's-

329
00:34:22.977 --> 00:34:25.187
Nice to meet you!

330
00:34:25.313 --> 00:34:26.563
I'm Fung.

331
00:34:26.689 --> 00:34:29.316
It's an honor to meet
such a great businessman.

332
00:34:29.442 --> 00:34:31.777
- He's got a lot of style.
- Fung is a soccer coach.

333
00:34:31.903 --> 00:34:33.195
Soccer coach!

334
00:34:33.321 --> 00:34:36.490
The world famous soccer coach.

335
00:34:36.616 --> 00:34:38.408
You play soccer with your legs. right?

336
00:34:38.534 --> 00:34:40.952
So. do you have a job for me?

337
00:34:41.079 --> 00:34:43.872
- I want you to join my soccer team.
- Soccer team?

338
00:34:43.998 --> 00:34:45.999
I haven't had a job in six months.

339
00:34:46.125 --> 00:34:49.086
You can use your Empty Hand
to be the goalkeeper.

340
00:34:49.212 --> 00:34:52.255
What's Empty Hand?
It's been so long.

341
00:34:52.381 --> 00:34:54.341
You know. I even forgot
when our master died.

342
00:34:54.467 --> 00:34:57.969
Listen. We're going to sign up
for the Supercup Tournament.

343
00:34:58.096 --> 00:35:00.305
The prize is one million dollars.

344
00:35:00.431 --> 00:35:03.141
Really? You must be the smart one.

345
00:35:03.267 --> 00:35:05.602
You see? You're dressed up.

346
00:35:05.728 --> 00:35:08.980
Our master taught us
that kung fu was sacred.

347
00:35:09.107 --> 00:35:12.234
Now. you have this crazy idea
to use Shaolin for soccer.

348
00:35:12.360 --> 00:35:13.527
Look.

349
00:35:13.653 --> 00:35:15.403
This is the group picture
of our master and brothers.

350
00:35:15.530 --> 00:35:17.739
I keep it under my pillow.

351
00:35:17.865 --> 00:35:19.699
Great! Let's sit down
to talk about the picture.

352
00:35:22.078 --> 00:35:24.913
I'll call you.
Keep a spot open for me.

353
00:35:27.375 --> 00:35:31.419
Get lost! I really can't talk now.
My clients are waiting for me.

354
00:35:31.546 --> 00:35:33.880
I'm doing a million dollar deal.
Can you hear me?

355
00:35:34.006 --> 00:35:36.258
My driver's off today.

356
00:35:36.384 --> 00:35:40.554
I lent my car to a friend
and left my wallet in my office.

357
00:35:40.680 --> 00:35:43.390
I can't have lunch.
I never do.

358
00:35:43.516 --> 00:35:45.517
I'm late! Please leave me alone.

359
00:35:46.060 --> 00:35:50.272
Third Brother. you could use your
Iron Shirt technique as a fullback-

360
00:35:50.398 --> 00:35:53.024
What's Iron Shirt?

361
00:35:53.151 --> 00:35:55.777
Look. There are planes in the sky.

362
00:35:55.903 --> 00:35:57.737
There are computers everywhere.

363
00:35:57.864 --> 00:36:00.031
It's the 21 st century.
Please don't daydream.

364
00:36:00.158 --> 00:36:03.243
I think we should combine
kung fu with soccer.

365
00:36:03.369 --> 00:36:06.621
- We could win a lot of money.
- Are you crazy?

366
00:36:06.747 --> 00:36:10.584
There's no way I'm taking time off
to play soccer.

367
00:36:10.710 --> 00:36:12.919
Sorry. your odds are terrible.

368
00:36:13.045 --> 00:36:16.298
We don't know anything about soccer.

369
00:36:16.424 --> 00:36:18.175
And let's be honest.

370
00:36:18.301 --> 00:36:21.094
We wouldn't stand a chance.

371
00:36:21.220 --> 00:36:23.471
In fact. the probability
of winning is 0%.

372
00:36:23.598 --> 00:36:25.849
- Proba-
- Probability.

373
00:36:25.975 --> 00:36:27.267
Watch.

374
00:36:27.393 --> 00:36:32.355
If I toss a coin it will be heads
or it will be tails.

375
00:36:32.481 --> 00:36:37.319
The probability that we'd win is the
same as a coin landing on its edge.

376
00:36:37.445 --> 00:36:39.988
- Let me try!
- Get lost!

377
00:36:40.740 --> 00:36:43.241
I'm having lunch with a client!

378
00:36:43.367 --> 00:36:45.911
You said you never eat lunch.

379
00:36:46.662 --> 00:36:51.583
Time is money.
I've lost a lot just talking to you!

380
00:37:09.393 --> 00:37:12.229
He's Sixth Small Brother.
Weight Vest.

381
00:37:12.355 --> 00:37:14.439
This is the famous soccer coach. Fung.

382
00:37:16.108 --> 00:37:17.442
Fung. how are you?

383
00:37:18.778 --> 00:37:20.862
- Lead Weight?
- Shaolin Light Weight.

384
00:37:20.988 --> 00:37:22.697
Nice to meet you. Mr. Weight.

385
00:37:23.366 --> 00:37:25.617
Fifth Brother.
you want to play soccer?

386
00:37:25.743 --> 00:37:29.621
Yes. If you use your
Light Weight skills as a winger...

387
00:37:29.747 --> 00:37:33.041
- our offense would be perfect.
- Are you sure?

388
00:37:33.167 --> 00:37:34.501
- Of course.
- Great.

389
00:37:34.627 --> 00:37:36.503
Do they sell diet pills here?

390
00:37:37.672 --> 00:37:39.130
It's useless.

391
00:37:39.257 --> 00:37:43.051
Ever since the virus got into my brain.
I just can't lose any weight.

392
00:37:43.177 --> 00:37:46.846
I'm no longer able to use
Shaolin kung fu Weight Vest...

393
00:37:46.973 --> 00:37:49.975
and I can't run anymore.

394
00:37:51.060 --> 00:37:53.728
Okay. you're a little overweight.
but it's not that important.

395
00:37:53.854 --> 00:37:55.855
Forget it.

396
00:37:57.024 --> 00:37:58.525
This was me.

397
00:38:00.444 --> 00:38:04.197
I can't even get a date
looking like this.

398
00:38:04.323 --> 00:38:06.283
You don't know what it's like.

399
00:38:06.409 --> 00:38:09.369
- I do. I can't get a date either.
- Really?

400
00:38:09.495 --> 00:38:11.746
I've read stories about your dates
in newspapers and magazines.

401
00:38:11.872 --> 00:38:14.666
- What kind of papers and magazines?
- I'm sorry.

402
00:38:15.584 --> 00:38:17.877
I can no longer control myself.

403
00:38:20.256 --> 00:38:21.923
Please leave me alone.

404
00:38:23.217 --> 00:38:24.884
Small Brother!

405
00:38:25.386 --> 00:38:28.388
Believe in yourself.
I know you can do it.

406
00:38:29.223 --> 00:38:31.141
Everyone calls me Lazy Pig now.

407
00:38:31.267 --> 00:38:33.685
You're the only one
who still calls me Small Brother.

408
00:38:36.731 --> 00:38:37.856
Thank you.

409
00:38:37.982 --> 00:38:40.942
Lazy Pig. get me that roll
of toilet paper.

410
00:38:44.905 --> 00:38:46.364
The red one.

411
00:39:08.888 --> 00:39:11.431
- Soccer?
- Yes. Second Brother!

412
00:39:11.557 --> 00:39:15.477
If you use Hooking Leg
as a fullback. I think-

413
00:39:15.603 --> 00:39:17.729
- We'd be perfect!
- Right!

414
00:39:17.855 --> 00:39:20.732
You think I can still do Hooking Leg?

415
00:39:22.234 --> 00:39:23.985
You just need practice.

416
00:39:24.111 --> 00:39:26.613
Believe in yourself.
and you'll get it back fast.

417
00:39:26.739 --> 00:39:28.490
I doubt it.

418
00:39:28.616 --> 00:39:31.326
Why are you washing dishes?

419
00:39:31.452 --> 00:39:33.411
I thought you were a waiter.

420
00:39:33.537 --> 00:39:36.706
Why? There are so many whys.

421
00:39:36.832 --> 00:39:37.957
I don't know.

422
00:39:38.084 --> 00:39:40.251
Why isn't my dad the rich?

423
00:39:41.337 --> 00:39:44.547
Why am I going bald
even though I'm so handsome?

424
00:39:44.673 --> 00:39:47.133
Why aren't you going bald
since you're so ugly?

425
00:39:47.259 --> 00:39:51.679
Everyone else enjoyed their youth.
but I had to study Shaolin?

426
00:39:51.806 --> 00:39:55.350
Just to become a dishwasher?
To clean up after people?

427
00:39:56.852 --> 00:39:58.561
Calm down. Second Brother.

428
00:39:58.687 --> 00:40:00.897
You should try to enjoy life.

429
00:40:01.023 --> 00:40:05.527
Enjoy life? Stay here.
and I'll enjoy killing you!

430
00:40:07.029 --> 00:40:08.696
Enjoy life?

431
00:40:10.157 --> 00:40:13.451
You call that toilet clean?
It smells awful.

432
00:40:13.577 --> 00:40:17.330
If it ever smells this bad again.
you'll clean it with your tongue.

433
00:40:56.954 --> 00:41:01.082
Your apartment looks great!
It's well furnished.

434
00:41:01.208 --> 00:41:03.585
I can't believe you work
as a janitor...

435
00:41:03.711 --> 00:41:07.881
but live in the penthouse
on the 59th floor.

436
00:41:08.007 --> 00:41:10.049
You've got good taste.

437
00:41:10.718 --> 00:41:16.055
This kind of apartment is so popular.
I can't even get one.

438
00:41:16.724 --> 00:41:21.561
The ventilation is okay.
It's just a bit noisy.

439
00:41:21.687 --> 00:41:24.522
Can I move in with you?

440
00:41:38.120 --> 00:41:42.415
Forget it.
Your brothers aren't coming.

441
00:41:42.541 --> 00:41:45.001
We can find other players.

442
00:41:45.127 --> 00:41:47.754
It's my fault.
I'm not persuasive enough.

443
00:41:48.756 --> 00:41:54.219
Not true.
You persuaded me. didn't you?

444
00:42:56.657 --> 00:42:58.866
We don't have much time...

445
00:42:58.993 --> 00:43:01.035
and you guys have a lot to learn.

446
00:43:01.161 --> 00:43:04.539
So listen up and work as a team.

447
00:43:04.665 --> 00:43:06.874
All right! Let's go!

448
00:43:14.091 --> 00:43:18.803
Sell all my shares.
Yes. all five of them!

449
00:43:18.929 --> 00:43:20.888
Don't laugh.

450
00:43:21.015 --> 00:43:22.932
Hold on. I have another call.

451
00:43:23.058 --> 00:43:25.226
It's coming down!

452
00:43:32.026 --> 00:43:34.319
You finally decided
to come back down. huh?

453
00:43:34.445 --> 00:43:36.279
We waited over an hour for you.

454
00:43:39.116 --> 00:43:41.576
- What are you doing?
- Playing soccer!

455
00:43:41.702 --> 00:43:43.536
The ball is over there!

456
00:43:50.252 --> 00:43:52.086
You! Come here!

457
00:43:52.880 --> 00:43:55.256
Let me see you kick the ball.

458
00:43:55.382 --> 00:43:58.259
- The ball is over there.
- Yes. It's over there.

459
00:43:58.385 --> 00:44:01.554
How can you kick it
if you can't even find it?

460
00:44:03.098 --> 00:44:06.893
Now. there are four basic soccer drills:
Pass. dribble. hold and shoot.

461
00:44:07.019 --> 00:44:08.895
- Coach!
- Shut up!

462
00:44:09.021 --> 00:44:11.189
Let's get started.

463
00:44:12.232 --> 00:44:13.900
Here.

464
00:44:16.570 --> 00:44:17.862
Hold it.

465
00:44:17.988 --> 00:44:21.032
Watch it. Concentrate.

466
00:44:24.870 --> 00:44:27.538
Don't lose it.
You can do better than that.

467
00:44:27.665 --> 00:44:30.083
Have you never seen a ball before?

468
00:44:30.959 --> 00:44:33.086
You play like an old woman.

469
00:44:34.129 --> 00:44:36.673
Fung. why can't I practice with them?

470
00:44:36.799 --> 00:44:40.760
Your leg is strong.
but you have no control.

471
00:44:40.886 --> 00:44:43.638
What if you kick the ball up
and hit a plane?

472
00:44:43.764 --> 00:44:46.516
- Ever thought of that?
- No.

473
00:44:46.642 --> 00:44:48.601
Small Brother.
I borrowed your eggs.

474
00:44:48.727 --> 00:44:49.811
What?

475
00:44:50.479 --> 00:44:53.731
If you can kick an egg without
breaking it. you can play with us.

476
00:44:53.857 --> 00:44:55.400
No problem.

477
00:44:56.694 --> 00:44:59.112
See. It's not easy.

478
00:45:08.080 --> 00:45:10.581
Small Brother. stop it.

479
00:45:16.171 --> 00:45:18.673
Oh. my God! My egg.

480
00:45:18.799 --> 00:45:20.508
I'll get you another one.

481
00:45:20.634 --> 00:45:23.886
I'll get you!
How could you do that!

482
00:45:24.012 --> 00:45:26.472
Concentrate.

483
00:45:30.018 --> 00:45:32.478
My egg!

484
00:45:48.245 --> 00:45:49.912
Yes! Yes!

485
00:45:54.042 --> 00:45:55.543
Go!

486
00:46:41.757 --> 00:46:43.758
Yes. Go!

487
00:47:03.445 --> 00:47:07.365
What are you doing?
How could you miss that one?

488
00:47:07.491 --> 00:47:10.368
Get it! Come on!

489
00:47:51.952 --> 00:47:56.455
- He's great.
- He could win a game by himself.

490
00:47:57.624 --> 00:48:01.627
No. It takes teamwork to win.

491
00:48:11.346 --> 00:48:15.516
The game is 30 minutes.
with no breaks.

492
00:48:15.642 --> 00:48:18.144
We'll follow the standard rules.
I'll referee.

493
00:48:18.270 --> 00:48:20.187
- Anyone object?
- Of course not.

494
00:48:20.314 --> 00:48:24.692
We're honored
to have Golden Leg referee.

495
00:48:24.818 --> 00:48:27.320
All of us are big fans.

496
00:48:27.988 --> 00:48:29.739
- This is Fung!
- Fung!

497
00:48:29.865 --> 00:48:31.490
Okay.

498
00:48:31.617 --> 00:48:36.704
Sing has already had
one run-in with your gang.

499
00:48:36.830 --> 00:48:41.542
Let's be civilized.
and just play a clean game.

500
00:48:41.668 --> 00:48:44.337
Their tidy uniform
and friendly faces...

501
00:48:44.463 --> 00:48:48.674
- indicate that they are sincere.
- Thank you.

502
00:48:52.220 --> 00:48:55.181
Relax. I'm a mechanic.

503
00:48:55.307 --> 00:48:58.059
I carry this with me
so I won't lose it.

504
00:48:58.185 --> 00:49:00.645
- I'm always on call.
- Yes. of course.

505
00:49:03.523 --> 00:49:06.943
As I said. I'm a mechanic...

506
00:49:07.069 --> 00:49:09.320
and that's why I carry a hammer.

507
00:49:09.446 --> 00:49:13.115
I'm familiar with
your team's unusual reputation.

508
00:49:13.241 --> 00:49:14.533
Don't worry.

509
00:49:14.660 --> 00:49:19.246
Oh. good. I'm glad
we understand each other.

510
00:49:19.373 --> 00:49:23.042
You better watch out.
Shake hands.

511
00:49:50.737 --> 00:49:51.946
I'm open!

512
00:51:49.564 --> 00:51:51.315
Third Brother!

513
00:52:18.343 --> 00:52:22.429
We're under attack.
Send reinforcements.

514
00:52:22.556 --> 00:52:24.390
We need reinforcements!

515
00:52:36.403 --> 00:52:37.736
Stand up.

516
00:52:39.739 --> 00:52:42.199
Get up! Stand up now!

517
00:52:43.451 --> 00:52:44.869
I said now!

518
00:52:46.246 --> 00:52:49.748
- What are you doing?
- They're killing us.

519
00:52:49.875 --> 00:52:51.876
What did you expect?

520
00:52:52.002 --> 00:52:55.713
You're going to let them
get away with this?

521
00:52:55.839 --> 00:52:57.840
You're ejected!

522
00:52:58.884 --> 00:53:00.718
Are you nuts?

523
00:53:03.763 --> 00:53:05.181
This is a test.

524
00:53:05.307 --> 00:53:08.684
If you guys can't pass it.
you shouldn't even bother playing!

525
00:53:08.810 --> 00:53:12.271
We just want to play soccer.
not fight a war.

526
00:53:12.397 --> 00:53:15.441
Soccer is war.
You must learn that.

527
00:53:24.117 --> 00:53:29.580
I surrender!

528
00:53:40.967 --> 00:53:42.676
I surrender.

529
00:53:43.762 --> 00:53:46.680
You can't surrender.
We're still at war.

530
00:53:46.806 --> 00:53:48.682
We're not letting you go home.

531
00:53:51.686 --> 00:53:53.646
I can't take it anymore.

532
00:53:53.772 --> 00:53:57.775
We're not good enough
to play with you.

533
00:53:59.152 --> 00:54:01.320
Let me go to a doctor.

534
00:54:07.494 --> 00:54:09.495
Put this on your head.

535
00:54:10.705 --> 00:54:12.790
Look at you.
you look like a stray dog.

536
00:54:13.917 --> 00:54:17.378
Where's your dignity?
I don't ever want to see you again.

537
00:54:17.504 --> 00:54:19.964
Put it on your head
then you can go see a doctor.

538
00:54:31.184 --> 00:54:35.062
Yes. I'm a dog. I have no dignity.

539
00:54:36.064 --> 00:54:37.523
Give it to me.

540
00:55:11.433 --> 00:55:13.726
Now it's our turn.

541
00:55:14.728 --> 00:55:16.353
What?

542
00:55:16.479 --> 00:55:19.523
Their powers are back.
I can feel it.

543
00:57:32.615 --> 00:57:34.366
- Get your shoes ready!
- All right!

544
00:57:34.492 --> 00:57:35.492
The final attack!

545
00:58:07.275 --> 00:58:09.943
I can't believe I missed.

546
00:58:10.904 --> 00:58:12.404
Help!

547
00:58:13.239 --> 00:58:16.575
Thank you for helping us
get our kung fu back.

548
00:58:18.077 --> 00:58:20.412
I'm honored to have you back.

549
00:58:20.538 --> 00:58:22.206
It's our honor.

550
00:58:25.543 --> 00:58:26.835
Just a second.

551
00:58:26.961 --> 00:58:29.379
I'm the one who is honored.

552
00:58:30.423 --> 00:58:33.634
You're going to make me rich!
Thank you!

553
00:58:35.803 --> 00:58:36.929
We're sorry.

554
00:58:37.055 --> 00:58:39.515
Can we join your team?
Please give us a chance!

555
00:58:39.641 --> 00:58:40.974
Please!

556
00:59:56.759 --> 00:59:58.760
Not a bad kick.

557
00:59:58.886 --> 01:00:01.930
A bit more work
and Team Evil will be unbeatable.

558
01:00:08.354 --> 01:00:09.688
Who is this?

559
01:00:10.690 --> 01:00:12.316
The cripple?

560
01:00:12.442 --> 01:00:14.401
- What's wrong?
- I'm sorry!

561
01:00:14.527 --> 01:00:18.530
If it's an open tournament.
why won't you let me sign up?

562
01:00:19.198 --> 01:00:21.491
Golden Leg!
What are you doing?

563
01:00:21.618 --> 01:00:22.951
- Hung!
- He-

564
01:00:23.077 --> 01:00:23.702
It's okay.

565
01:00:23.828 --> 01:00:26.246
Hung. my team wants to sign up.

566
01:00:26.372 --> 01:00:28.999
Anyone can sign up
for an open tournament.

567
01:00:29.125 --> 01:00:30.584
That's not how it works.

568
01:00:30.710 --> 01:00:32.294
I'm the chairman.

569
01:00:32.420 --> 01:00:34.504
I decide who signs up.

570
01:00:34.631 --> 01:00:36.590
- You get me?
- Yes.

571
01:00:36.716 --> 01:00:38.467
What's the name of your team?

572
01:00:38.593 --> 01:00:40.636
Come here.

573
01:00:40.762 --> 01:00:42.387
This is Hung.

574
01:00:42.513 --> 01:00:44.181
Hung!

575
01:00:59.197 --> 01:01:00.864
This is quite a team.

576
01:01:00.990 --> 01:01:02.783
I've gotta see them play.

577
01:01:02.909 --> 01:01:04.618
What's the name again?

578
01:01:04.744 --> 01:01:05.994
This is Shaolin-

579
01:01:06.120 --> 01:01:07.913
Okay.

580
01:01:08.039 --> 01:01:10.207
Go ahead and sign them up.

581
01:01:10.333 --> 01:01:12.793
I'll even pay your application fee.

582
01:01:12.919 --> 01:01:14.795
- Thank you!
- Don't mention it.

583
01:01:14.921 --> 01:01:18.090
Cripple. you are my brother.

584
01:01:19.967 --> 01:01:21.968
My shoe is dirty again.

585
01:01:23.137 --> 01:01:25.097
White shoes get dirty a lot.

586
01:01:25.223 --> 01:01:26.264
So-

587
01:01:26.933 --> 01:01:28.392
I'll clean it for you!

588
01:01:28.518 --> 01:01:30.769
I'm good at cleaning. Let me try.

589
01:01:31.521 --> 01:01:33.230
It's my duty.

590
01:01:33.356 --> 01:01:35.023
Let me try!

591
01:01:59.382 --> 01:02:00.382
Hi.

592
01:02:05.096 --> 01:02:07.806
What's going on?

593
01:02:13.229 --> 01:02:15.188
Where are we going?

594
01:02:15.314 --> 01:02:17.357
Why are you so quiet?

595
01:02:18.151 --> 01:02:20.360
I need to go home.

596
01:02:26.909 --> 01:02:30.662
- You're late.
- I won't be long.

597
01:03:02.737 --> 01:03:04.029
Try it on.

598
01:03:04.155 --> 01:03:06.573
No. I just want to see
the quality of it.

599
01:03:06.699 --> 01:03:07.991
Touch it.

600
01:03:08.117 --> 01:03:09.618
I'll get it dirty.

601
01:03:09.744 --> 01:03:11.369
- Don't worry. Go ahead!
- No!

602
01:03:11.496 --> 01:03:13.914
- Touch it!
- No.

603
01:03:16.876 --> 01:03:19.628
- Like it?
- So smooth.

604
01:03:19.754 --> 01:03:23.423
- Want one?
- I touched it. That's enough.

605
01:03:24.842 --> 01:03:27.803
Tomorrow. I'm going to play
in a professional soccer game.

606
01:03:27.929 --> 01:03:29.304
Really?

607
01:03:29.430 --> 01:03:31.932
I'll be famous.

608
01:03:32.809 --> 01:03:35.685
But if you hadn't fixed my shoes...

609
01:03:35.812 --> 01:03:37.896
none of this would've happened.

610
01:03:38.981 --> 01:03:40.941
You're very important to me.

611
01:03:42.777 --> 01:03:44.528
I'll get you anything you want.

612
01:03:44.654 --> 01:03:46.738
I'll have money soon.

613
01:03:50.284 --> 01:03:53.912
If you become rich and famous.
please buy me sneakers.

614
01:03:54.580 --> 01:03:57.040
You deserve more!

615
01:03:57.166 --> 01:03:59.960
You should have more
confidence in yourself.

616
01:04:00.086 --> 01:04:03.338
You're such a beautiful girl.
and you're a kung fu master.

617
01:04:03.464 --> 01:04:05.090
You've got it all.

618
01:04:05.216 --> 01:04:08.343
You shouldn't let your hair
cover your face.

619
01:04:09.178 --> 01:04:10.804
Come on!

620
01:04:10.930 --> 01:04:12.889
- Come on. Look at me!
- No.

621
01:04:13.015 --> 01:04:14.933
Look at me!

622
01:04:16.477 --> 01:04:18.937
You're beautiful!

623
01:04:20.022 --> 01:04:21.439
Really?

624
01:04:21.566 --> 01:04:23.275
Sure.

625
01:04:28.865 --> 01:04:31.408
- Is that a fly?
- Yes. but I missed it.

626
01:04:32.368 --> 01:04:34.452
- Did you get it?
- I did.

627
01:04:34.579 --> 01:04:36.413
Sorry. I made your hand dirty.

628
01:04:36.539 --> 01:04:37.914
It's okay.

629
01:04:38.040 --> 01:04:40.125
You're such a beautiful girl.

630
01:04:42.461 --> 01:04:44.170
Do you know that?

631
01:04:44.297 --> 01:04:45.380
I guess.

632
01:04:45.506 --> 01:04:48.800
Thank you! Thanks so much!
You sure you know?

633
01:04:51.387 --> 01:04:52.679
Where were you?

634
01:04:52.805 --> 01:04:55.891
I let you bring a girl here because
you promised to clean the floor.

635
01:04:56.017 --> 01:04:58.476
I will get punished
if you don't clean it.

636
01:04:58.603 --> 01:05:01.104
Go home. I'll call you later.

637
01:05:07.445 --> 01:05:11.197
Remember: Be confident.
You're the best.

638
01:05:16.329 --> 01:05:18.580
- I like your shirt.
- I like your socks.

639
01:05:18.706 --> 01:05:19.998
- Let's trade.
- Good.

640
01:05:20.124 --> 01:05:23.793
Guys. don't be nervous.
Just try to have fun.

641
01:05:23.920 --> 01:05:26.046
There'll be tons of reporters
and a big crowd.

642
01:05:26.172 --> 01:05:28.673
Try to smile for the photographers.

643
01:05:28.799 --> 01:05:31.927
Be sure to thank the fans.

644
01:05:32.053 --> 01:05:33.887
Thank you!

645
01:05:37.892 --> 01:05:40.852
Thanks for your support!
Thank you!

646
01:05:40.978 --> 01:05:43.563
- They're just janitors.
- They're still our audience.

647
01:05:43.689 --> 01:05:45.231
Thank you!

648
01:05:45.358 --> 01:05:47.192
Shut up!

649
01:05:48.444 --> 01:05:50.904
Where is everyone. You said-

650
01:05:51.030 --> 01:05:52.447
It's just the first round.

651
01:05:52.573 --> 01:05:55.200
We have to make it to the finals.

652
01:05:55.326 --> 01:05:58.745
- Great! Let's get to the finals!
- Shut up!

653
01:06:06.587 --> 01:06:08.713
Team Shaolin?

654
01:06:12.760 --> 01:06:14.260
Look at this guy.

655
01:06:18.140 --> 01:06:19.891
Look at that guy.

656
01:06:23.521 --> 01:06:25.105
What's wrong?

657
01:06:25.231 --> 01:06:26.898
No smoking?

658
01:06:41.205 --> 01:06:42.747
What happened?

659
01:06:44.125 --> 01:06:46.751
It's impossible. Just a trick.

660
01:06:55.136 --> 01:06:57.137
What's going on?

661
01:06:59.181 --> 01:07:01.474
Okay. it's a trick.

662
01:07:01.600 --> 01:07:03.685
Let's show them what we can do.

663
01:07:03.811 --> 01:07:04.811
All right!

664
01:07:08.024 --> 01:07:09.649
Oh. come on!

665
01:07:17.324 --> 01:07:21.327
Please play fair.
Give us a chance.

666
01:07:25.124 --> 01:07:26.958
Hung. it's for you.

667
01:07:30.796 --> 01:07:34.174
Your tricks don't scare me!

668
01:08:08.876 --> 01:08:11.711
What? Forty to zip?

669
01:08:21.514 --> 01:08:23.014
Yeah!

670
01:08:39.865 --> 01:08:42.200
Iron Head scores!

671
01:09:17.319 --> 01:09:19.362
We bring the power of Shaolin
to soccer.

672
01:09:19.488 --> 01:09:22.282
Kung fu is great. It's wonderful!

673
01:09:22.950 --> 01:09:27.162
I want to say hi to my parents and
my Shaolin master. but they're all dead.

674
01:09:27.288 --> 01:09:29.038
I also want to say hi
to my friend. Mui.

675
01:09:29.165 --> 01:09:30.957
Mui. how are you?

676
01:09:31.083 --> 01:09:33.334
I'll see you soon.

677
01:09:44.180 --> 01:09:46.139
Hi. Can I help you?

678
01:09:46.265 --> 01:09:48.349
- I want-
- I understand.

679
01:09:48.475 --> 01:09:50.476
I'll take care of you.

680
01:09:59.278 --> 01:10:00.904
Show us something.

681
01:10:01.030 --> 01:10:02.864
Sure. Small Brother!

682
01:10:05.284 --> 01:10:06.618
Great!

683
01:10:07.286 --> 01:10:09.037
Can you show us more?

684
01:10:09.163 --> 01:10:10.496
Sure!

685
01:10:27.223 --> 01:10:29.057
Take it easy.

686
01:10:32.811 --> 01:10:38.566
My brothers. today we say good-bye
to our old lives and old shoes.

687
01:10:43.280 --> 01:10:45.782
- Hey. don't throw those around.
- Sorry.

688
01:10:53.874 --> 01:10:54.874
Mui?

689
01:10:55.542 --> 01:10:56.876
What's up?

690
01:10:58.128 --> 01:11:00.088
You look great tonight.

691
01:11:02.549 --> 01:11:03.508
Just a little.

692
01:11:03.634 --> 01:11:06.386
It's a big difference.
You're so heavily made up.

693
01:11:07.763 --> 01:11:09.055
So you think I look nice?

694
01:11:09.181 --> 01:11:12.600
I have big news for you.
We won the soccer match.

695
01:11:12.726 --> 01:11:16.104
I know. I saw you guys on TV.

696
01:11:16.230 --> 01:11:17.230
Congratulations.

697
01:11:18.274 --> 01:11:20.275
This is for you.

698
01:11:27.199 --> 01:11:28.116
Thank you.

699
01:11:28.242 --> 01:11:30.201
Let me introduce you to my friends.

700
01:11:31.245 --> 01:11:32.537
Nice outfit.

701
01:11:32.663 --> 01:11:35.415
Hey. let me introduce you guys
to a new friend.

702
01:11:35.541 --> 01:11:37.000
Is she a ghost?

703
01:11:37.126 --> 01:11:39.502
This is my friend.

704
01:11:39.628 --> 01:11:41.504
- Girlfriend?
- No.

705
01:11:41.630 --> 01:11:44.507
This is Mui. the Tai Chi Master
I told you guys about.

706
01:11:44.633 --> 01:11:47.218
- Oh. nice to meet you.
- Your girlfriend is quite unique.

707
01:11:47.344 --> 01:11:49.762
- Yes.
- That's great.

708
01:11:50.597 --> 01:11:53.099
I've never seen
shoulder pads so big.

709
01:11:53.225 --> 01:11:55.935
I've decided to start a new trend.

710
01:11:56.061 --> 01:11:57.979
See? It's fashionable.

711
01:11:59.273 --> 01:12:02.233
Don't walk around at night.

712
01:12:02.359 --> 01:12:03.985
It's quite scary.

713
01:12:04.111 --> 01:12:08.197
It's okay.
People will get used to it soon.

714
01:12:08.324 --> 01:12:11.326
It will work pretty well in football.

715
01:12:11.452 --> 01:12:13.411
You want to borrow them?

716
01:12:14.330 --> 01:12:16.581
Stop it. It's not proper to talk
to a lady like this.

717
01:12:16.707 --> 01:12:19.167
It's okay. I can take it.

718
01:12:19.293 --> 01:12:22.628
Although she's a girl.
she has a great sense of humor.

719
01:12:24.298 --> 01:12:26.799
Mui. show us a sexy pose.

720
01:12:32.848 --> 01:12:34.932
Give us a kiss.

721
01:12:43.442 --> 01:12:44.942
- What's wrong?
- Don't touch me.

722
01:12:49.114 --> 01:12:50.448
Are you mad?

723
01:12:52.117 --> 01:12:55.828
- No. I'm not mad.
- Then-

724
01:13:02.586 --> 01:13:04.087
I'm sorry.

725
01:13:05.339 --> 01:13:06.923
We were just joking.

726
01:13:07.049 --> 01:13:09.384
I know you were just joking.

727
01:13:10.636 --> 01:13:12.553
I'm sorry.
I didn't mind at all-

728
01:13:12.679 --> 01:13:14.180
Don't be like this.

729
01:13:14.306 --> 01:13:16.391
Then why are you like this?

730
01:13:25.943 --> 01:13:27.735
Take your hand off me-

731
01:13:27.861 --> 01:13:29.195
Boss!

732
01:13:29.321 --> 01:13:31.072
What the hell are you doing?

733
01:13:31.198 --> 01:13:32.865
I was just out playing mah-jongg.

734
01:13:32.991 --> 01:13:36.744
Look at what you did to yourself?
You look like a ghost.

735
01:13:36.870 --> 01:13:39.038
Have you no shame?
You are such a disgrace.

736
01:13:39.164 --> 01:13:40.373
Hey. enough!

737
01:13:41.875 --> 01:13:44.752
Mui has the right
to dress how she wants.

738
01:13:44.878 --> 01:13:47.171
Can't you respect that?

739
01:13:47.297 --> 01:13:49.924
- I think she looks very nice today.
- Yes.

740
01:13:50.050 --> 01:13:52.218
- She looks great.
- Don't be mean to her.

741
01:13:54.513 --> 01:13:57.598
I'll yell at her if I want to.
Who the hell are you guys?

742
01:13:58.559 --> 01:13:59.892
They are my friends.

743
01:14:03.605 --> 01:14:05.940
I agree with them completely.

744
01:14:08.902 --> 01:14:10.903
I think I look beautiful now.

745
01:14:12.197 --> 01:14:14.323
And I like the way I am.

746
01:14:16.368 --> 01:14:18.244
If you don't like it...

747
01:14:18.954 --> 01:14:20.746
you can simply go away.

748
01:14:22.458 --> 01:14:24.750
Who do you think
you're talking to?

749
01:14:26.044 --> 01:14:27.879
I'm talking to you.

750
01:14:28.922 --> 01:14:31.048
You are a mean
and coldhearted boss.

751
01:14:31.175 --> 01:14:32.758
You're asking for it!

752
01:14:34.386 --> 01:14:37.263
How dare you hit me?

753
01:14:45.898 --> 01:14:49.108
I can't believe this.
Who do you think you are?

754
01:14:51.820 --> 01:14:55.198
I am who I am.
I am Mui.

755
01:14:55.324 --> 01:14:58.284
I'm gonna tell
your mother about this.

756
01:15:03.874 --> 01:15:05.416
Mui. well done!

757
01:15:05.542 --> 01:15:08.419
We were just joking earlier.
Please forgive us.

758
01:15:08.545 --> 01:15:12.507
We weren't laughing at you.
your sexy pose really was sexy.

759
01:15:16.470 --> 01:15:17.637
Really?

760
01:15:26.313 --> 01:15:27.855
Do you...

761
01:15:27.981 --> 01:15:30.233
like the way I look?

762
01:15:30.359 --> 01:15:31.442
Well-

763
01:15:31.568 --> 01:15:34.946
You certainly have more confidence.

764
01:15:41.995 --> 01:15:43.913
I want to tell you something.

765
01:15:44.039 --> 01:15:45.706
What?

766
01:15:46.875 --> 01:15:48.251
I like you.

767
01:15:48.377 --> 01:15:50.294
I like you too.

768
01:15:53.257 --> 01:15:55.675
Is this love?

769
01:15:59.263 --> 01:16:01.055
You-

770
01:16:01.181 --> 01:16:02.682
You're joking.

771
01:16:03.600 --> 01:16:07.311
No. I'm serious.

772
01:16:08.313 --> 01:16:10.356
Absolutely not. This is not love.

773
01:16:14.820 --> 01:16:17.196
We're friends forever.

774
01:16:18.615 --> 01:16:20.741
Don't you think we should be friends?

775
01:16:20.867 --> 01:16:22.660
It's fine.

776
01:16:29.876 --> 01:16:34.547
So you'll still come see me?

777
01:16:35.632 --> 01:16:38.217
I can still fix your shoes.

778
01:16:38.343 --> 01:16:42.054
No. thanks. I can buy new ones.

779
01:16:42.723 --> 01:16:45.433
Things have changed.

780
01:16:45.559 --> 01:16:48.185
I have to think about the future.

781
01:16:56.903 --> 01:16:58.779
Don't be like this.

782
01:16:59.823 --> 01:17:01.907
You're crying.

783
01:17:03.577 --> 01:17:05.411
Don't be that way.

784
01:17:17.507 --> 01:17:19.300
I understand.

785
01:17:20.719 --> 01:17:22.053
Sorry.

786
01:17:25.641 --> 01:17:28.893
- Congratulations!
- Sit with us.

787
01:17:29.019 --> 01:17:30.478
Cheers!

788
01:17:38.445 --> 01:17:40.529
If we win this. we'll go to the finals.

789
01:17:40.656 --> 01:17:41.739
To the finals!

790
01:17:41.865 --> 01:17:44.283
- But don't underestimate our opponent.
- Underestimate our opponent!

791
01:17:48.246 --> 01:17:51.165
You don't have a chance.

792
01:17:51.291 --> 01:17:53.292
We haven't lost all year.

793
01:18:02.719 --> 01:18:04.261
How'd they do that?

794
01:18:04.388 --> 01:18:06.097
It must be special effects.

795
01:19:25.719 --> 01:19:28.179
- Good morning. Hung.
- Good morning.

796
01:19:28.305 --> 01:19:29.764
Come here.

797
01:19:29.890 --> 01:19:32.183
You're a lucky guy.

798
01:19:32.309 --> 01:19:34.268
You're lucky to coach
such a great team.

799
01:19:34.394 --> 01:19:35.311
Thank you.

800
01:19:35.437 --> 01:19:38.898
Iron Head and Iron Shirt is practiced
as performance art on the street.

801
01:19:39.024 --> 01:19:41.066
It's amusing to see your team
use kung fu to play soccer...

802
01:19:41.193 --> 01:19:42.902
and make it to the finals.

803
01:19:43.028 --> 01:19:44.945
You did a good job.

804
01:19:45.071 --> 01:19:46.989
Don't waste our time.

805
01:19:48.617 --> 01:19:51.243
If you forfeit the game
you can join my Evil Team.

806
01:19:53.079 --> 01:19:56.123
It's not a bad check this time.

807
01:19:56.249 --> 01:19:58.918
You can get the money
before you sign the deal.

808
01:19:59.753 --> 01:20:01.378
That's a lot of money.

809
01:20:01.505 --> 01:20:03.464
Enough to retire.

810
01:20:03.590 --> 01:20:06.550
Of course. We're like brothers.

811
01:20:06.676 --> 01:20:09.804
Thank you.
But I don't think I can accept it.

812
01:20:10.889 --> 01:20:13.724
What? Do you think
I'm trying to trick you?

813
01:20:13.850 --> 01:20:16.644
I think you've
put a great team together.

814
01:20:16.770 --> 01:20:18.687
I'd like you to come work for me.

815
01:20:18.814 --> 01:20:20.606
Don't get upset.

816
01:20:20.732 --> 01:20:23.400
Think about your future.
Forget about our past. okay?

817
01:20:24.319 --> 01:20:27.321
Hung. I'm not mad at you anymore.

818
01:20:27.989 --> 01:20:32.117
I know it was all my faults.
I can't blame anyone else.

819
01:20:33.870 --> 01:20:35.496
You're lying.

820
01:20:35.622 --> 01:20:38.457
I know you too well.
You're too greedy to pass this up.

821
01:20:41.253 --> 01:20:42.837
You're right.

822
01:20:43.588 --> 01:20:46.507
I am greedy.
My team is greedy too.

823
01:20:46.633 --> 01:20:49.134
But we don't care about the money.

824
01:20:49.261 --> 01:20:51.178
We care about the championship.

825
01:20:52.556 --> 01:20:53.806
See you on the soccer field.

826
01:21:28.842 --> 01:21:30.509
Pull over.

827
01:21:36.182 --> 01:21:38.517
- Mui!
- She's dead!

828
01:21:39.185 --> 01:21:40.853
How?

829
01:21:41.521 --> 01:21:43.898
- I killed her!
- Impossible!

830
01:21:44.024 --> 01:21:47.651
Mui is a kung fu master.
You could never hurt her.

831
01:21:47.777 --> 01:21:49.820
What do you want?

832
01:21:49.946 --> 01:21:52.114
Revenge!

833
01:21:52.782 --> 01:21:54.992
Come on. It was only a joke.

834
01:21:55.118 --> 01:21:57.703
She's still alive.
She just doesn't work here anymore.

835
01:21:58.788 --> 01:22:00.581
Why not?

836
01:22:00.707 --> 01:22:03.459
Well. we're famous for our
sweet steamed buns...

837
01:22:03.585 --> 01:22:06.545
and Mui made
the sweetest ones of all.

838
01:22:06.671 --> 01:22:10.591
But now they're salty and bitter.
She was ruining my business.

839
01:22:10.717 --> 01:22:12.009
There was salt in them?

840
01:22:12.135 --> 01:22:13.761
Yes.

841
01:22:13.887 --> 01:22:16.180
Now is there anything else
I can do for you. sir?

842
01:22:20.018 --> 01:22:22.019
No thanks.

843
01:23:26.543 --> 01:23:27.835
Hey!

844
01:23:28.420 --> 01:23:30.295
We've got a game to play!

845
01:25:08.520 --> 01:25:12.106
Will Team Evil
score a lot of goals today?

846
01:25:12.232 --> 01:25:14.775
Scoring goals is not
the only way to win.

847
01:25:15.985 --> 01:25:18.070
But make no mistake. we will win.

848
01:27:56.145 --> 01:27:57.437
No way!

849
01:28:01.985 --> 01:28:04.569
Those American drugs
work better than I expected.

850
01:28:26.259 --> 01:28:28.343
Actually. the referee. linesman...

851
01:28:28.469 --> 01:28:32.264
soccer association. soccer federation
and soccer committee...

852
01:28:32.390 --> 01:28:35.809
all stand on my side.
How can they possibly beat me?

853
01:29:08.843 --> 01:29:12.012
No problem!

854
01:29:14.057 --> 01:29:15.640
- You rule!
- Good job!

855
01:29:16.309 --> 01:29:17.351
You the man!

856
01:30:16.702 --> 01:30:20.539
Throw-in? Are you crazy?

857
01:30:20.665 --> 01:30:23.583
How can you call that a throw-in?

858
01:30:23.709 --> 01:30:26.211
Hung. are you here to fight
or play soccer?

859
01:30:26.963 --> 01:30:29.381
I should break their legs
like I broke yours!

860
01:30:29.507 --> 01:30:32.175
Then you'd have
a whole team of cripples!

861
01:30:32.301 --> 01:30:35.887
Cripples! Cripples!
At least you'd have company.

862
01:30:38.808 --> 01:30:41.017
I'm sorry. I should take a break.

863
01:30:41.144 --> 01:30:43.812
It's okay.
Your body may leave the field...

864
01:30:43.938 --> 01:30:46.440
but your spirit will stay behind.

865
01:31:03.708 --> 01:31:05.917
Get ready! It's my turn.

866
01:31:24.854 --> 01:31:26.229
Small Brother!

867
01:32:02.934 --> 01:32:05.810
Wake up! The clock already ran out.

868
01:32:12.818 --> 01:32:15.362
It's only halftime.
Their team is already badly injured.

869
01:32:15.488 --> 01:32:17.447
They won't be able to play
the second half. Go home!

870
01:32:17.573 --> 01:32:19.533
You won't be able
to finish the game.

871
01:32:19.659 --> 01:32:21.076
Boring.

872
01:32:21.202 --> 01:32:23.495
I'll dance to provide
some entertainment.

873
01:32:23.621 --> 01:32:26.623
No. you're not going to dance.
I am!

874
01:32:31.754 --> 01:32:33.171
I've had enough.

875
01:32:49.564 --> 01:32:51.189
Break it up!

876
01:32:53.234 --> 01:32:55.235
You want me to eject someone?

877
01:32:56.195 --> 01:32:58.113
Who did that?

878
01:32:58.239 --> 01:32:59.781
Did anyone see?

879
01:33:01.033 --> 01:33:02.909
I'd like to see you do that
to my face!

880
01:33:03.786 --> 01:33:05.078
Gently.

881
01:33:05.204 --> 01:33:07.914
What kind of kung fu was that?

882
01:33:08.040 --> 01:33:11.459
I can't take much more!

883
01:33:12.587 --> 01:33:15.547
I knew they would play dirty.

884
01:33:15.673 --> 01:33:17.591
I just didn't think
they would play this dirty.

885
01:33:17.717 --> 01:33:19.467
They've never been this good.

886
01:33:19.594 --> 01:33:21.761
They must be cheating.

887
01:33:21.887 --> 01:33:23.430
Call the police.

888
01:33:23.556 --> 01:33:26.099
We just have to play harder.

889
01:33:26.225 --> 01:33:27.642
We can still win this!

890
01:33:27.768 --> 01:33:29.728
I forgot. I left the oven on!

891
01:33:29.854 --> 01:33:32.772
My wife needs me.
She's about to have a baby.

892
01:33:32.898 --> 01:33:36.192
Can't she wait until the game's over?

893
01:33:36.319 --> 01:33:38.153
But they're killing us!

894
01:33:38.279 --> 01:33:40.071
Please. I'm begging you.

895
01:33:40.197 --> 01:33:43.700
- I'm begging you too.
- Wait. Wait!

896
01:33:45.411 --> 01:33:48.413
Calm down.

897
01:33:48.539 --> 01:33:49.998
Calm down!

898
01:33:51.542 --> 01:33:54.377
He's right!

899
01:33:54.962 --> 01:33:58.173
We must pull together.

900
01:33:58.841 --> 01:34:00.634
We only have eight players left.

901
01:34:00.760 --> 01:34:04.679
If one more is injured.
we have to forfeit.

902
01:34:04.805 --> 01:34:07.766
We'll have to show these guys
that we can block their killer kicks!

903
01:34:07.892 --> 01:34:10.644
That's easy for you to say.
You try blocking one of them.

904
01:34:10.770 --> 01:34:12.771
What are you talking about?

905
01:34:13.689 --> 01:34:15.148
Calm down.

906
01:34:15.274 --> 01:34:18.068
Calm down!

907
01:34:18.194 --> 01:34:19.944
Shut up.

908
01:34:26.285 --> 01:34:28.328
I wonder if I can block them.

909
01:34:44.762 --> 01:34:46.346
Shaolin Barricade Shield!

910
01:34:49.642 --> 01:34:50.850
Barricade?

911
01:34:53.938 --> 01:34:56.314
They can't even block one kick!

912
01:34:58.317 --> 01:34:59.943
- Are you okay?
- I'm fine.

913
01:35:39.650 --> 01:35:41.651
Chun. it's Tin.

914
01:35:43.446 --> 01:35:48.032
I've kept this secret for 20 years.

915
01:35:48.159 --> 01:35:50.994
I love you.

916
01:36:37.041 --> 01:36:38.792
Are we playing too dirty?

917
01:36:38.918 --> 01:36:41.836
- I don't think so.
- Really?

918
01:36:41.962 --> 01:36:43.755
Play even dirtier!

919
01:37:16.080 --> 01:37:18.289
Brothers! Go!

920
01:37:19.458 --> 01:37:20.333
What?

921
01:37:24.046 --> 01:37:26.089
Look out!

922
01:37:52.366 --> 01:37:53.658
Get it!

923
01:37:56.745 --> 01:37:57.996
I don't believe it.

924
01:38:23.731 --> 01:38:25.982
Get up! If you're injured.
you forfeit!

925
01:38:27.067 --> 01:38:29.569
You're right. I'm fine.

926
01:38:34.575 --> 01:38:37.160
The game's almost over!
Use the special attack!

927
01:38:37.286 --> 01:38:39.037
Special attack?

928
01:39:11.236 --> 01:39:15.782
That's it. They're out of players.
We won!

929
01:39:22.039 --> 01:39:25.458
Team Shaolin.
I only see seven players.

930
01:39:25.584 --> 01:39:29.295
If you don't have a substitute
you'll forfeit the game.

931
01:39:29.421 --> 01:39:31.422
Those are the rules.

932
01:39:36.929 --> 01:39:38.930
Any substitutes?

933
01:39:40.265 --> 01:39:42.642
Congratulations!

934
01:39:45.270 --> 01:39:47.063
I'm here.

935
01:39:47.189 --> 01:39:49.399
I'm their substitute.

936
01:39:49.525 --> 01:39:51.526
I'm a goalie.

937
01:39:57.574 --> 01:39:59.450
Why do you look like E.T.?

938
01:40:00.452 --> 01:40:03.121
You said I should
get rid of the hair in my eyes.

939
01:40:03.247 --> 01:40:04.414
What are you doing here?

940
01:40:04.540 --> 01:40:06.290
I want to help.

941
01:40:06.417 --> 01:40:08.167
How can you help?

942
01:40:08.293 --> 01:40:10.586
Phone home.
You don't belong on Earth.

943
01:40:10.713 --> 01:40:12.964
I really want to help.
Trust me.

944
01:40:13.090 --> 01:40:15.508
- Let me try.
- No way!

945
01:40:15.634 --> 01:40:18.845
Look. You can't play in those.

946
01:40:20.973 --> 01:40:22.640
Put these on.

947
01:41:07.978 --> 01:41:09.812
The other side.

948
01:41:21.950 --> 01:41:23.117
Go!

949
01:41:23.243 --> 01:41:24.702
All right!

950
01:41:39.968 --> 01:41:41.385
Watch out!

951
01:43:49.681 --> 01:43:54.393
What happened?

952
01:43:54.519 --> 01:43:57.396
- Boss. watch out!
- Don't touch me!

953
01:44:00.859 --> 01:44:06.030
Boss!

954
01:45:31.616 --> 01:45:36.120
Shaolin Team wins the championship.

955
01:45:38.332 --> 01:45:40.791
Evil Team's drug use leads to
permanent suspension.

956
01:45:40.917 --> 01:45:43.252
Coach Hung sentenced
to five years in jail.

957
01:46:58.870 --> 01:47:00.371
Wait.

958
01:47:00.497 --> 01:47:02.832
Stop the bus.

959
01:47:27.566 --> 01:47:30.734
Phone home.
You don't belong on Earth.

960
01:47:31.611 --> 01:47:34.029
I'm talking about thousands of dollars.

961
01:47:34.156 --> 01:47:36.949
You're a bunch of losers-

962
01:47:37.075 --> 01:47:38.951
Don't laugh.

963
01:47:39.077 --> 01:47:41.203
The grand prize is a lot of money.

964
01:47:45.125 --> 01:47:46.834
I can't get it out.

965
01:47:46.960 --> 01:47:49.962
I'm a postgraduate student.

966
01:47:50.088 --> 01:47:52.006
Postgraduate student?

967
01:47:52.132 --> 01:47:53.215
Let's start over.

968
01:47:53.341 --> 01:47:56.594
I'm a postgraduate student.

969
01:47:58.221 --> 01:48:00.264
- What's wrong?
- Don't touch me.

970
01:48:00.932 --> 01:48:01.974
Are you mad?

971
01:48:02.100 --> 01:48:04.602
No. I'm not mad.

972
01:48:10.775 --> 01:48:12.943
- What's wrong?
- Don't touch me.

973
01:48:13.778 --> 01:48:14.945
Are you mad?

974
01:48:15.071 --> 01:48:17.072
- I'm not mad.
- Then-

975
01:48:26.500 --> 01:48:28.834
I am begging you.

976
01:48:28.960 --> 01:48:31.629
Don't do this.

977
01:48:32.631 --> 01:48:34.882
You have to help me.

978
01:48:35.008 --> 01:48:37.009
Please. don't!

979
01:48:39.554 --> 01:48:41.472
It's great

980
01:48:41.598 --> 01:48:43.766
I don't know the lyrics. Sorry.

981
01:48:46.311 --> 01:48:47.978
Don't you dare!

982
01:48:54.110 --> 01:48:56.612
- They're just janitors.
- They're still our-

983
01:48:58.907 --> 01:49:01.867
I heard you have amazing legs.

984
01:49:04.120 --> 01:49:04.954
Cut!

985
01:49:05.080 --> 01:49:09.875
This is a crescent wrench.
It's for screwing-

986
01:49:10.001 --> 01:49:11.877
- Are you sure?
- You're so sick.

987
01:49:12.003 --> 01:49:14.672
My team is greedy too.

988
01:49:14.798 --> 01:49:17.383
But we don't care
about this plane ticket-

989
01:49:17.509 --> 01:49:19.218
Plane ticket?
Are you going somewhere?

990
01:49:43.326 --> 01:49:46.662
Chun. it's Tin.

991
01:49:47.414 --> 01:49:51.375
I've kept this secret for 20 years.

992
01:49:51.501 --> 01:49:54.086
I love you.

993
01:49:54.212 --> 01:49:56.672
This is not Chun.
This is Kung.

994
01:49:56.798 --> 01:49:58.841
Sorry. Kung.

995
01:49:58.967 --> 01:50:01.969
Please tell your wife
what I just told you.

996
01:50:02.305 --> 01:51:02.691
Support us and become VIP member 
to remove all ads from www.OpenSubtitles.org
